User Story: Additional Fixes for System Stability and Reliability During Setup - iOS & Android
Task: Perform End-to-End Testing for the Setup Process

Overview:
As a tester, I conducted end-to-end testing of the setup process on both iOS and Android platforms.
The tests covered all stages of the setup, including initial configurations, network connections, and account synchronization.
Testing confirmed that the setup process was stable and reliable, with no crashes, freezes, or critical issues identified on either platform.
